:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDCRTF.Create File Commands - Help
:P.Create File Commands: every command whose name starts with CRT and carries F, in name order, with the command name at the right of its row. The option numbers follow the full IBM i command set, so a blank row is a command this release does not provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command groups.
:EHELP.
